{"id":"20260830T004329.683062538Z-c8ea4ba6","time":"2026-08-30T00:43:29.683062538Z","session_id":"session-20260830T002012.706816133Z","task_id":"task-1788049212707426532","source":"claude","kind":"output","summary":"{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CeY1JwfrAmVh1ecyJF8zG\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"The graph confirms the invariant behind f2 (`roles.adversarial_roles_inherit_nothing_and_bind_to_a_revision`). Let me materialize the revision:\"}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2093,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":109759,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":2093},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"55d34540-5161-4344-aa41-f2d3346381f6\",\"uuid\":\"64461df4-6830-4364-8160-573708216992\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-30T00:43:29.682Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011CeY1Jvtxii5q4tudbBFKV\"}","payload":{"stream":"stdout"}}
{"id":"20260830T004337.946681857Z-981a139a","time":"2026-08-30T00:43:37.946681857Z","session_id":"session-20260830T002012.706816133Z","task_id":"task-1788049212707426532","source":"claude","kind":"output","summary":"{\"type\":\"assistant\",\"message\":{\"model\":\"claude-opus-5\",\"id\":\"msg_011CeY1JwfrAmVh1ecyJF8zG\",\"type\":\"message\",\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"tool_use\",\"id\":\"toolu_01A3y3QNefADyzSM8YRwyubr\",\"name\":\"Bash\",\"input\":{\"command\":\"cd \\\"$(git rev-parse --show-toplevel)\\\" \u0026\u0026 git add -A internal/gitx/git.go internal/gitx/git_test.go internal/report/report.go internal/report/report_test.go internal/workflow/engine.go internal/workflow/engine_test.go internal/workflow/testedit.go \u0026\u0026 git commit -q -F - \u003c\u003c'MSG'\\nCompare candidate paths as Git spells them; refuse an uncommitted candidate\\n\\nPath identity is Git's. gitx.ChangeSet reads\\n`git diff --no-ext-diff --name-status -z` on NUL boundaries, so no pathname\\nGit can produce is lost or split, and both sides of a rename or copy survive.\\nrunCandidate obtains it at both binding points -- over the worker's diff and\\nover the re-read after validation, because a formatter can widen a candidate --\\nreconciles it against report.FromDiff, and refuses the candidate when the two\\nreadings disagree, before validation, inspection, audit, classification or\\nreview reads it. confineToPlan compares those paths EXACTLY: no TrimSpace on\\neither side, no case folding, no separator rewriting, and no test-edit grant.\\n\\\" internal/workflow/engine.go\\\" and \\\"internal/workflow/engine.go\\\" are different\\nfiles.\\n\\nreport.FromDiff is repaired as a renderer: Git-quoted and C-escaped headers,\\nand copy records, which it previously lost entirely. It reports a type change\\nas the two records the diff format writes it as; the engine knows that pair is\\nGit's one `T` record and reconciles them as one reading rather than refusing a\\nvalid candidate before its reviewer sees it.\\n\\nA run that produced a candidate no longer reaches terminal completion while\\nthat candidate is uncommitted: it refuses, naming the uncommitted paths, rather\\nthan reporting work ready for governed admission that its branch does not hold.\\n\\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) \u003cnoreply@anthropic.com\u003e\\nMSG\\ngit log --oneline -1 \u0026\u0026 git rev-parse HEAD\",\"description\":\"Commit the candidate to materialize its revision\"},\"caller\":{\"type\":\"direct\"}}],\"stop_reason\":null,\"stop_sequence\":null,\"stop_details\":null,\"usage\":{\"input_tokens\":2,\"cache_creation_input_tokens\":2093,\"cache_read_input_tokens\":109759,\"cache_creation\":{\"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens\":0,\"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens\":2093},\"output_tokens\":3,\"service_tier\":\"standard\",\"inference_geo\":\"not_available\"},\"diagnostics\":null,\"context_management\":null},\"parent_tool_use_id\":null,\"session_id\":\"55d34540-5161-4344-aa41-f2d3346381f6\",\"uuid\":\"b6ce05ac-0208-4097-aa66-996170614f51\",\"timestamp\":\"2026-08-30T00:43:37.944Z\",\"request_id\":\"req_011CeY1Jvtxii5q4tudbBFKV\"}","payload":{"stream":"stdout"}}
